      "effects": [],
      "text": "Retribution: Counterattacking with Tidecaller at the precise moment when the character is hit grants the maximum DMG Bonus."
    },
    {
      "id": "beidou.passive2",
      "unlock": "p2",
      "effects": [],
      "text": "Lightning Storm: Gain the following effects for 10s after unleashing Tidecaller with its maximum DMG Bonus: \n·DMG dealt by Normal and Charged Attacks is increased by 15%. ATK SPD of Normal and Charged Attacks is increased by 15%.\n·Greatly reduced delay before unleashing Charged Attacks."
    },
    {
      "id": "beidou.passive3",
      "unlock": "p3",
      "effects": [],
      "text": "Conqueror of Tides: Decreases swimming Stamina consumption for your own party members by 20%.\nNot stackable with Passive Talents that provide the exact same effects."
    }
  ],
